                                      <\/a>\n                    <\/div>\n\n                    <div id=\"Collapse-14514dc69343e3894ca2\" class=\" show collapse\" aria-labelledby=\"primaryHeading-0-19a8af5\" data-parent=\"#accordion-69343e3894ca2\">\n\n                        <div class=\"elementskit-card-body ekit-accordion--content\">\n                            <p>If you suspect investment fraud, it is crucial to report your concerns to the MTGride immediately. They will help you to file a complaint. Provide them with as much information as possible, including any documentation or communication related to the suspected fraud. Reporting fraud not only helps protect yourself but also prevents others from falling victim to the same scheme.<\/p>                        <\/div>\n\n                    <\/div>\n\n                <\/div><!-- .elementskit-card END -->\n\n                \n                <div class=\"elementskit-card \">\n                    <div class=\"elementskit-card-header\" id=\"primaryHeading-1-19a8af5\">\n                        <a href=\"#collapse-35c8fe469343e3894ca2\" class=\"ekit-accordion--toggler elementskit-btn-link collapsed\" data-ekit-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#Collapse-35c8fe469343e3894ca2\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"Collapse-35c8fe469343e3894ca2\">\n                            \n                            <span class=\"ekit-accordion-title\">Can I recover my losses if I have been a victim of investment fraud?<\/span>\n\n                            \n                                <div class=\"ekit_accordion_icon_group\">\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_normal_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Normal Icon -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"17\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 17\" fill=\"none\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M7.19995 16.5V0.5H8.79995V16.5H7.19995Z\" fill=\"#3D3D3D\"><\/path><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M-2.08616e-07 7.69995L16 7.69995L16 9.29995L-2.78554e-07 9.29995L-2.08616e-07 7.69995Z\" fill=\"#3D3D3D\"><\/path><\/svg>                                    <\/div>\n\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_active_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Active Icon -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"3\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 3\" fill=\"none\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M-2.08616e-07 0.499999L16 0.5L16 2.5L-2.78554e-07 2.5L-2.08616e-07 0.499999Z\" fill=\"#675AFE\"><\/path><\/svg>                                    <\/div>\n                                <\/div>\n\n                            \n                                                    <\/a>\n                    <\/div>\n\n                    <div id=\"Collapse-35c8fe469343e3894ca2\" class=\" collapse\" aria-labelledby=\"primaryHeading-1-19a8af5\" data-parent=\"#accordion-69343e3894ca2\">\n\n                        <div class=\"elementskit-card-body ekit-accordion--content\">\n                            <p>While recovering losses from investment fraud can be challenging, there are steps you can take to seek restitution. It is essential to consult with a legal professional from MTGride, experienced in investment fraud cases, to explore your options. In some cases, you may be able to participate in class-action lawsuits or work with authorities to identify and freeze assets of the fraudster.<\/p>                        <\/div>\n\n                    <\/div>\n\n                <\/div><!-- .elementskit-card END -->\n\n                \n                <div class=\"elementskit-card \">\n                    <div class=\"elementskit-card-header\" id=\"primaryHeading-2-19a8af5\">\n                        <a href=\"#collapse-c29457c69343e3894ca2\" class=\"ekit-accordion--toggler elementskit-btn-link collapsed\" data-ekit-toggle=\"collapse\" data-targ